## Replace subject-only triage

Read [decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject),
[the triage rule](/kb/triage/dedupe), and [the original incident page](/kb/incidents/4471)
alongside their rendered components. The old decision and triage page retain their historical wording;
their review dates trigger the layout's staleness warning. An accepted decision should be superseded
by a new decision, not silently rewritten.

Subjects can match across different causes, and different subjects can describe the same cause.
Check tenant configuration and the report's channel before merging.
An unknown tenant yields no cause; it is not sufficient evidence for a duplicate.

